{"id":"00050","root":"uni00050_1","name":{"ja":"秋山　凜子","en":"Akiyama Rinko"},"title":{"ja":"【空装武神】","en":"【Sky-Armored War God】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【空装武神】 秋山　凜子","en":"【Sky-Armored War God】 Akiyama Rinko"},"element":"Science","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2018-09-25","limited":false,"characterId":1,"profile":{"ja":"ＤＳＯ所属でありながら、特殊な運営を続けている、オレンジインダストリーから、魔族への強襲依頼を受け、共同戦線に参加している凜子。ゆきかぜとともに強襲要員として参加している。対魔忍としての素性を隠すため、愛刀と対魔忍スーツを着ていない。専用の戦闘スーツに身を包み、専用の武器“空装武神”を使用している。凜子の空遁の術を極限まで攻撃力に変換させる武器であり、２刀の刀身に周囲の空間を可能な限り凝縮し、防御不能の斬撃を繰り出せるようになっている。さらにその斬撃を飛ばす事も可能であり、強襲としての能力が格段に上がっている。身体ポテンシャルは装備のおかげで元々以上には引き上がっているが、逸刀流や胡蝶乱舞を使用する事ができなくなっている。","en":"Rinko, while belonging to DSO, continues a special operation for Orange Industry and has taken a raid request against the demons, joining the joint front. She participates in the raid as a strike force together with Mizuki Yukikaze. To hide her identity as a Taimanin, she does not wear her beloved sword or a Taimanin suit. Instead she dons a dedicated combat suit and wields the exclusive weapon \"Sky-Armored War-God\". The weapon converts Rinko's sky-step technique into pure attack power to the limit, condensing the surrounding space into the two blade edges so she can unleash an unstoppable slash. It can also launch that slash as a projectile, greatly boosting her raid capabilities. Her physical potential is already elevated by the equipment, but she can no longer use Ittou-ryu or Butterfly Dance."},"illustrator":"葵渚","voiceActor":"北板利亜","forms":[{"id":"uni00050_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[788,1576],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[113,226],"def":[86,172],"spd":[81,81],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":31,"skills":["5","119"]},{"id":"uni00050_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1176,2352],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[176,352],"def":[122,244],"spd":[81,81],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":31,"skills":["5","119","120"]},{"id":"uni00050_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR"